{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/a8bb2b750260febd69e6aeb46e730b6b.avif?t=1774290351\" width=615 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chess of Mana is chess like you\u2019ve never seen before, a magical battlefield where capturing a piece isn\u2019t the end\u2026 it\u2019s just the beginning.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this vibrant fantasy world, Celts and Orcs clash in strategic duels powered by a magical resource called Mana. With it, you can revive fallen pieces and turn the tide of battle in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the fear of making bold moves and losing your pieces! In Chess of Mana, every move can trigger a comeback, and every fallen unit has the potential to return to the fight. Here, the King is more than just a target, he is the source of all Mana power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/773b768451eef6cf708503969ac85efb.avif?t=1774290351\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/01abd5d2a8f6ddb90929253d3dda9e85.poster.avif?t=1774290351\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/01abd5d2a8f6ddb90929253d3dda9e85.webm?t=1774290351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new way to play chess where pieces can return to the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mana Chess redefines traditional strategy and introduces entirely new tactical playstyles. The ability to revive captured pieces creates a fresh dynamic that has even experienced chess players rethinking their approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/c6eb7a2b4fb7b37d5786d179dcce5973.avif?t=1774290351\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/7c43ee1b0a7e3998aaff99147b45feac.avif?t=1774290351\" width=616 height=220 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer a more traditional experience? You can play Classic Chess too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy standard chess gameplay enhanced by Chess of Mana\u2019s charming pixel art visuals and epic soundtrack. Let\u2019s be honest, it\u2019s way more fun watching characters sprint across the board and clash in battle during every capture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/b8e742515b3051c15833e76d420226ad.avif?t=1774290351\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/f41105c0c48ec10cf72381a3d93bda06.poster.avif?t=1774290351\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/f41105c0c48ec10cf72381a3d93bda06.webm?t=1774290351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess of Mana features a unique artistic direction and expressive animations that transform the board into a true battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every capture feels satisfying and impactful. Just wait until you see the Queen\u2019s magical powers in action, it\u2019s seriously awesome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/71d656ed1c92a1b3840d40b9fec37460.avif?t=1774290351\" width=760 height=85 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/e7482a325a69162e5682cd67dd0ef1ec.poster.avif?t=1774290351\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/extras/e7482a325a69162e5682cd67dd0ef1ec.webm?t=1774290351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In war, the battlefield is always someone\u2019s homeland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s why Chess of Mana features themed boards that create unique battle atmospheres for each match. We put a lot of love into the pixel art, and it truly stands out as one of the game\u2019s visual highlights.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Vit\u00f3ria F\u00e1cil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3778350/af0dea4bdc76f3cae43d3c938efe72960cefee95.jpg"},{"name":"Vit\u00f3ria F\u00e1cil de Mana","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3778350/b50c0828a41a4c5f1a5ed6aa1d3128b2795937c8.jpg"},{"name":"Orc em Xeque!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/377